# Admin is not a permission

When a schema uses an admin-only policy, enforce that policy at its entry points. Keep the audit label for the operation separate from its authorization decision. Use the permission catalog when the schema grants access per operation.

```csharp
if (!user.IsAdmin)
    throw new ForbiddenError("Недостаточно прав");
```
